Bonjour Valentin,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">En effet, la SFAC et ALLIANZ (notre assurance-crédit client), nous signal la perte de l&#8217;assurance de ton encours chez nous.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">Cependant, cette situation est temporaire, car en attente de ton bilan.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">2 solutions s&#8217;offrent à toi&nbsp;:\\n<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<ul style=\\"margin-top:0cm\\" type=\\"disc\\">\\n<li class=\\"MsoListParagraph\\" style=\\"margin-left:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">Soit tu m&#8217;envoie ton BILAN et je l&#8217;envoie directement à notre assurance citée ci-dessus.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class=\\"MsoListParagraph\\" style=\\"margin-left:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">Sois tu passes par ton comptable.<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">Je reste à ta disposition pour discuter de ce problème.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\">Bonne journée<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<table class=\\"MsoNormalTable\\" border=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" width=\\"1556\\" style=\\"width:1167.1pt;margin-left:5.4pt;border-collapse:collapse\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\"height:17.05pt\\">\\n<td width=\\"306\\" rowspan=\\"7\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"width:229.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:17.05pt\\">\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><a href=\\"https://www.cica-agencement.fr/\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"292\\" height=\\"158\\" style=\\"width:3.0416in;height:1.65in\\" id=\\"_x0000_i1030\\" src=\\"https://www.cica-agencement.fr/PartageWeb/signature_mail/banner_cica.png\\"></span></a><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\"126\\" rowspan=\\"2\\" style=\\"width:94.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:17.05pt\\">\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><a href=\\"https://www.cica-agencement.fr/\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"110\\" height=\\"55\\" style=\\"width:1.15in;height:.575in\\" id=\\"_x0000_i1029\\" src=\\"https://www.cica-agencement.fr/PartageWeb/signature_mail/CICA.png\\"></span></a><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\"40\\" style=\\"width:29.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:17.05pt\\">\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><a href=\\"https://www.facebook.com/CicaMours\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"25\\" height=\\"19\\" style=\\"width: