-id":"447","x-spamd-result":"448","x-rspamd-action":"449"},"<html>\\n<head>\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\">\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nRebonjour,&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nJ’en ai parlé avec Valentin, j’avoue que ma mission s’arrête à la mise en place pour que le lie fonctionne,&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nJe pense qu’il faut que tu les contact pour qu’ils ouvrent l’accès ou autre ?&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nPar contre, on pourra ensemble mettre en place sur le site un lien qui redirige vers le configurateur bien entendu\\n<span>😊&nbsp;</span></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<span><br>\\n</span></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<span>Excellente journée !&nbsp;</span></div>\\n<div id=\\"ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line\\" dir=\\"ltr\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<div id=\\"ms-outlook-mobile-signature\\" dir=\\"ltr\\"><span style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">--&nbsp;</span>\\n<table class=\\"signature-table\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"text-align: left; width: 750px; max-width: 750px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td class=\\"signature-table\\" style=\\"text-align: left; padding: 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 220px;\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><img src=\\"http://signature.jlcs.fr/jlcom/logo.png\\" alt=\\"Logo JL Communication\\" id=\\"img-e4d8f7c1-2dd4-47c6-a7af-fa05c51e3bc5\\" width=\\"220\\" style=\\"width: 220px; height: auto; max-width: 320px; display: block;\\"></span></td>\\n<td class=\\"signature-table\\" style=\\"text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px 5px 15px; vertical-align: middle;\\">\\n<div class=\\"signature-table\\" style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><b>Cédric</b></span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><b>LE GALL - SAVOURET</b></span></div>\\n<div class=\\"poste\\" style=\\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(21, 128, 211);\\">\\nWebmaster - Co-gérant</div>\\n<div class=\\"signature-table\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"coord\\" style=\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.45; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\\">\\n<img src=\\"http://signature.jlcs.fr/jlcom/phone.png\\" alt=\\"Téléphone\\" id=\\"iconFixe\\" width=\\"14\\" height=\\"14\\" style=\\"width: 14px; height: 14px; margin-right: 6px;\\">&nbsp;<span style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\"><b>Fixe :</b></span>&nbsp;<a href=\\"tel:04 75 27 48 00\\" data-outlook-id=\\"b7ee92d2-27fb-476f-ad6f-bf2bd34802e3\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-decoration: none;\\">04\\n 75 27 48 00</a><br>\\n<img src=\\"http://signature.jlcs.fr/jlcom/smartphone.png\\" alt=\\"Téléphone\\" id=\\"iconPortable\\" width=